at he's seen the diary. She snaps at him for prying but he urges her to listen. Hazel refuses to discuss this, but Aaron begs her to at least watch the diaries herself and she reluctantly agrees. Later, Aaron and Jackson return home just as Hazel is replacing the laptop. Hazel pretends to be upbeat but a look passes between her and Aaron and it's clear their secret is going to be a heavy one to bear.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-17\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":65,\"name\":\"Episode 5872 (Fri 18th Mar 2011)\",\"overview\":\"Jimmy has agreed to meet Kelly the following day against Carl's advice, sure that she holds the key to his lost memory. When Nicola asks him to take Angelica to nursery at the same time as his scheduled meeting, he quickly claims that he has to go out on a job and Carl covers him.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":66,\"name\":\"Episode 5873 (Mon 21st Mar 2011)\",\"overview\":\"Carl passes on a message to Jimmy from Kelly about a new meeting place. Later that day, Kelly waits at a café for a late Jimmy to show, getting anxious and watching the clock. As the door to the café opens, Kelly's put out to see Carl take up a seat opposite her - wanting her to stay out of Jimmy's life. However, she hints that she was already seeing Jimmy before the amnesia.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-21\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":67,\"name\":\"Episode 5874 (Tue 22nd Mar 2011)\",\"overview\":\"Carl reminds Jimmy about Kelly's true colours and is pleased that Jimmy has decided to see the specialist again and move back in with Nicola. Later, Kelly rings Jimmy and tells him that Carl turned up and threatened her. Carl is shocked and insists to Jimmy that she was far from threatened and he was just trying to help.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-22\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":68,\"name\":\"Episod